# xAI (Grok) key for the dayboard. Copy this file to .env.local and paste your key.
# It is read by the dev server only — vite.config.ts proxies /api/xai and adds the header
# server-side, so the key never reaches the browser bundle.
# Without it the dayboard still runs on its local read; the status line says which you are seeing.
XAI_API_KEY=
